# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/user/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### SignIn(需要真实 Casdoor authorization code; 假 code 预期 500/invalid_grant, 不是 invalid_client——后者说明凭据配错)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/user.v1.UserService/SignIn
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "replace-with-casdoor-code", "state": "cli"}

### UserProfile(直连, 身份头模拟网关)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/user.v1.UserService/UserProfile
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{}

### UserProfile(LAN 网关)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/user.v1.UserService/UserProfile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### UserProfile(公网网关)
POST https://{{public_gateway_host}}/user.v1.UserService/UserProfile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}
